abstract: >-
  Turns the history of a research field into a metro-style map (Liniennetzplan).
  Each line is a group, each station a dated, sourced milestone, and a toggle
  switches between two ways of grouping the same stations. Built with Claude
  (AI-assisted).
keywords:
